when.markdownDescription:
A condition the core evaluates in `context`: true, false or null. A list means all of them. Absent: the rule is a definition only.

```yaml
when: { predicate: depth_mm, lt: 3 }
when: [ { predicate: status, eq: pending }, { predicate: due_on, within_days: 5 } ]
when: { via: mounted_on, direction: in, any: { predicate: depth_mm, lt: 3 } }
when: { predicate: status, eq: open, open_for_days: { gte: 7 } }
```
